## Context
Ticket 0043 fixed extract.py's glob to skip .eval.json files. The same
anti-pattern exists in other modules that glob *.json in output directories.

## Instances found
- analyze_multiturn_budget.py:25 — `output_dir.glob("*.json")` unfiltered,
  will load .eval.json files if present
- self_consistency.py:144 — safe (regex filters to -runN.json pattern)
- verify.py:632 — uses assistant_turns[-1] only; may be intentional for
  per-turn verification but should be reviewed

## Actions
1. Add .eval.json filter to analyze_multiturn_budget.py
2. Review verify.py last-turn-only logic — is it intentional?
3. Grep for any other *.json globs added after this sweep

## Exit criteria
- No module loads .eval.json by accident
